.waveto 5 n n sw    ask guan about 赌神秘术    answer yes    answer 正    轩辕三光说道: 哈! 不是反面, 妳猜正面就错了!    kill guan    search d search get book经世奇才之神算诸葛  1.in 圣贤书    ask sue about 雪苍山下  2.in 刘全书    s 2d read picture恶人证明 1.wa 4 n n w search n n pass rattan n n out    看见司马烟 (PS:fanset 7) 2.ask yen about 恶人证   ask yen about 燕南天 3.wa 4 n w   ask harlot about 水仙姑娘   ask harlot about 移花宫   ask hoodlum about 恶人谷 4.wa 1 s s s e e e n   ask dipi about 燕南天   ask dipi about 哭风坡 5.waveto 4   buy map from girl   read map 6.wa 3 e e e e e n    ask man about 燕南天   ask man about 蒙汗药   buy teapot from man   kill man 7.get paper open paper   put powder in teapot   send teapot to day  (燕南天死了) 8.get corpse waveto 7(回到司马烟那)   give corpse to yen炼妖壶之谜 及 老妇人的伤心事(通常这两个迷都是一起解的)炼妖壶之谜(combat_exp 20000以上比较好解)  1.从金刀门王元霸那开始 (save后 waveto 6 就是这里)    e 2n 2w 2s search shief 得到papyrus  2.2n 2e 2s e s ask liu about 借补虫网 拿到net  3.n w 2n 3w cover butterfly     抓到后give butterfly to girl  4.3e 2s e s give net to liu    它会说大小姐会解疑难杂症    n w 2n 4w s open door w     男的话会进不去,此时去找巧儿(n,e),她会带你去  5.ask leing about 翻译    ask leing about 古文书    give papyrus to leing  翻译完后会给你note  6.waveto 6 ask ba about 炼妖壶    n w 2n 4w n w     search statue move statue (PS:fanset 7)    break box (出现要龙虎刀之讯息)  7.ask ba about 龙虎刀    ask ba about 陈元贵  8.(到仙剑郑士钦那)in teng s s s s w w w     enter n n  见到陈元贵(fanset 8)  9.ask yuan about 金刀门      ask yuan about 龙虎刀    waveto 6 give blade to ba       waveto 7 break box look box 10.give blade to ba     ask ba about 炼妖壶   waveto 8    ask yuan about 炼妖壶      ask yuan about 紫金六阳刀法    give blade to ba       ask ba about 陈元贵 waveto 8 11.到魔教庄敬柔那 s sd     ask envoy about 锦袋  nod 2e     ask elder about 石牢     s ask envoy about 钥匙 fight envoy(get key) 12.n w se se e ed (fanset 9)    unlock north with key   open north    n  look box   push box   search hole (get lotch)    give lotch to ba (解完炼妖壶之谜)老妇人的伤心事   1.waveto 5 4n 3w sw s  fanset 8     ask woman about 儿子     nod (老妇人说等你的消息)   2.waveto 9 (听到赵青云说找envoy拿钥匙)     wu w nw nw e n      ask envoy about 钥匙     fight envoy(get key)   3.waveto 9      unlock south with key  open south  s     ask 赵青云 about 帮忙 (赵青云give u 1 jade)     waveto 8 give jade to woman京城大盗(combat_exp 100000以上再解)   1.waveto 1 3s w n enter 2n  (fanset 7)     ask chi about thief      accept test   2.waveto 1 3s     ask fighter about thief     show fighter     ask fighter about thief (得知scar)   3.到段云那 (save后能waveto 6 )     ask duan about thief     ask duan about scar   4.waveto 2 2n enter 3n     ask pin about liu     ask liu about sad_story   5.waveto 6  ask duan about chao     s 3w s unlock door with key     open door s search box     take firecracker  waveto 6     ask duan about firecracker   6.waveto 1 6n nu fire firecracker     (会一直跑...)停了后 search bush   7.3e ask thief about chao     ask chao about thief     会战斗      1.forgive  选择是pill或是sword     2.杀死chao get corpse  waveto 7       give corpse to chi血的挑战书及青龙之气血的挑战书(combat_exp 200000以上)  1.到圣贤书那里(save)    ask sue about 挑战书    ask sue about 困扰    ask sue about 因此    nod他会给你挑战书  2.waveto 4,4n,2e,climb pine,3u,w    干掉雪魂...(最好enforce 10以上)    不容易打死  要多打几次    最好是主力攻击的skills  lv 80以上  3.打死后去找圣贤书那里(waveto 6)     他就给你青龙之笛    挑战书就解了    在拿着青龙之笛到雪魂那..use de    青龙之气也解了仙云之气(解完青龙即可解)  1.in刘全书 4n 3w n     tear fon papers (出现一堆snow guard  最好教别人撕)    open box (get poet book)    s enter road n w 2e n e 2w 洋平杀死    searcy eye  get snow token(被拿走了请找人sac or auc)  2.in刘全书 4n 2w 3n enter w n (fanset 7)    give dugur poet book...    独孤云说道: 为了感谢你的帮助!!我就告诉你二个秘密!!!    独孤云说道: 一、刘全书及任正晴曾在玄天圣谷中修习更上层的绝学!!!    独孤云说道: 二、泷山掌门练有传说中的仙云灵气!!!  3.in 任正晴    ask jen about 仙云之气    任正晴续道:仙云之气在天灵谷之中,但要进天灵谷必须要有    青龙之气及天灵石才能进!!    ask jen about 玄天圣地    任正晴吟诗道:------雪~山~深~岭~中、苍~天~一~柱~峰-----    in 刘全书    ask liu about 仙云之气    ask liu about 玄天圣地     刘全书吟诗道:------仙~云~护~气~凌、身~在~圣~地~中-----  4.waveto 7    ask dugur about 天灵石      说拿天邪石去换    give stone to dugur  5.in master liu s 2d 2w enter water    2n w enter hole    2n search dragon     use sky_lin_stone   put sun    n stand 平台  仙云之气就解    (请打Help god_kee及sec_god看说明) 雪泉之谜      1.in刘全书4n 3w enter road n w 2e n e 2w 洋平杀死     searcy eye  get snow token(被拿走了请找人sac or auc)     out w w enter water n n w drink water魔刀现世(加max_force 100)  1.in 刘全书 s d d w kil1 taoist get sword from corpse  2.get 天邪石(找人帮忙打)  3.in 刘全书 4n e enter n u 9 w push key     give stone sword to oldman 叶狂的放法go jen 2e s d n type 玄武,青龙,青龙k jen, get key ,unlock door with key ,open doorn d 坤卦,兑卦,坤卦....k jen..get key..unlock door with key,open doorn kill jen 一样..but如果不让你开就unlock north with key,open north...n...typer free ya..ya就会出来了..ya出来的地点是wa 4 2n 3w....固定地点..要快点拦截..不然就跑了","to":"wuchy","from":"涟漪(amdxp)/转寄自混世间/转寄自混世间","time":1010162179,]),(["title":"fs大副份迷","text":"[36m                      FS 大部分的迷[0m[31m卖火材的小女孩     [0m    recall d give cloth to girl[31m农妇的便当[0m    waveto 5 2w ask woman about 便当    s 2e 6s 2w give bento to farmer[31m失落的红宝石[0m    waveto 5 2e n ask woman about 红宝石    waveot 1 6n give any stone[31m展伯承的烦恼     [0m    waveto 2 2n enter 2n w give 500 coin to guard    左侍卫给你一张搜索令.    waveto 2 2s 3e     give su_note to keeper    search 地板    show keeper blood 会跟客栈老板开打    客栈老板晕了或打死后  get all from corpse    w 3n w give picture to chen[31m赌神秘术 [0m  1.recall d n 2w 2s      ask man about 赌神秘术    ask man about 轩辕三光  2.waveto 5 n n sw    ask guan about 赌神秘术    answer yes    answer 正    轩辕三光说道: 哈! 不是反面, 妳猜正面就错了    多跟他玩几次    kill guan    search d search get book[31m经世奇才之神算诸葛[0m  1.in 圣贤书    ask sue about 雪苍山下  2.in 刘全书    s 2d read picture[31m恶人证明[0m 1.wa 4 n n w search n n pass rattan n n out    看见司马烟 (PS:fanset 7) 2.ask yen about 恶人证   ask yen about 燕南天  3.wa 4 n w   ask harlot about 水仙姑娘   ask harlot about 移花宫   ask hoodlum about 恶人谷 4.wa 1 s s s e e e n